Primary Exports:

Fusion Fuel: Refined deuterium and helium-3 from upper atmosphere skimming

Antimatter: Produced in high-orbit fusion facilities using massive power loops

Methane: Skimmed and processed for agricultural machinery and station backup fuel

Historic Export: Originally just hydrogen; antimatter production began ~60 years ago

Byproducts:

3g of standard matter (hydrogen slurry, carbon ash) per 1g of antimatter produced

Plasma waste vented into magnetically shielded drift stations or used in experimental reactor research
